"P225509995" "Return to the Hero Corps Field Analyst"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2837171289" "Wow, kiddo. Those Hero Corps guys don't mess around. Why don't you check in with the Field Analyst for a debriefing?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4136701981" "You completed your training mission, and learned that even the lowliest villains are not to be underestimated!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3783606960" "Hey, kiddo. I guess you and Grym had fun. He seemed a little crispy around the edges, you know?<br><br>Seriously, though, Grym was talking you up a few minutes ago. I think you seriously impressed that guy. With fighters like you guys on the team, I think we might just make it through this whole mess.<br><br>Speaking of which..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NoMindSidekick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3808560137" "My thanks again for fighting off those... er..."
// Answer Text :
"P629549506" "Let's just call them Clockwork."
// Page Clockwork Text :
"P3001757683" "Ah. Well, I have fought Clockwork before, but not like these. Alone, my fists cannot damage their armor plating, and I am helpless. <br><br>But then, I am no longer alone."
// Answer Text :
"P1860579681" "Uh, what do you mean?"
// Page Alone Text :
"P3182150774" "Your powers are obviously strong enough to defeat these... Clockwork. While I could not do such a thing by myself, I can certainly support you.<br><br>With your guidance, I could learn to strike their plating more effectively, and these unusual machines will learn to fear me. However, this can only be possible if I accompany you in your fight."
// Answer Text :
"P3938544908" "Wait, hold on. You're saying..."
// Page WhatAreYouSaying Text :
"P2716425644" "Yes, {HeroName}. If you do not mind, I would like to be your sidekick."
// Answer Text :
"P3514462294" "..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2513728323" "While you and Grym were off in the cooker, Proton clued me in on some strange readings he found. He was going on about disruptions in space-time and whatnot, but the gist of it is that the same guys that showed up in Galaxy are popping in around the city.<br><br>Proton asked me to check out a nearby warehouse where he's been getting those readings, but I... well. I've got my own leads to work on. Anyway, I thought maybe you could check it out, see what's up. We need to find out why the, um...<br><br><color orange>Twinshot pauses uncomfortably for a moment.</color><br><br>...I guess you already know that those things were Praetorian, right?"
// AcceptString :
"P1782048669" "Yes, I'm aware."
// SendOffString :
"P2885003618" "That's what I thought. Well, I'm damn sure they don't have a good reason for being here, and we need to know what they're after. I have a hunch or two, but any info you find could give us the inside edge, you know? Let me know what you find when you get back. I'm, ah...<br><br><color orange>Twinshot chokes up for a second. After a few moments, she recovers.</color><br><br>I'm really counting on you, kiddo."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1993647390" "Investigate the Clockwork Presence!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3150705647" "Look, kiddo, I'm fine. Please, just go check that warehouse. We need all the info we can get, you know?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2294175257" "<color deepskyblue>If You Don't Mind</color>"

