// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P851365868" "Confer with Grym About the Attack"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2675278514" "Give me a moment, kiddo. I think I'm onto something big. I'll talk with you in a moment."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1712191903" "You've agreed to set up an ambush with Grym. You don't like it, but you don't see any other option."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3317675342" "Hey, kiddo. You're back. How'd the research trip go?<br><br><color orange>You explain to Twinshot the basics of what happened, taking care to leave out the parts about her database entry, and your conversation with Grym.</color><br><br>Holy smokes, kiddo. Clockwork showed up <i>inside</i> the mansion? You'd think our benefactor would set up some sort of no-portal-zone or something. Yikes.<br><br>Anyway, glad to see you made it out safe. I need you to do a favor for me."
// RandomFameString :
"P2592553161" "Hey, {HeroName}, how's it... whoa, nevermind. Must be having a bad day."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Grym 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P46948226" "{HeroName}. You return as promised. Is the time to strike upon us?"
// Answer Text :
"P4288545054" "She's heading to base now. I think it's the best shot we have."
// Page BestShot Text :
"P3883769603" "Agreed. I will summon the rest of the team, and we will meet you there. If Twinshot has truly betrayed us, then we should all be present for her downfall.<br><br>It is... regrettable that we must do this. To strike down one's commander, even for a just cause... it is shameful."
// Answer Text :
"P616672870" "I don't feel any better about it than you do, Grym."
// Page FeelBad Text :
"P3210409513" "Then you are a {Hero.gender=male man|woman} of honor, {HeroName}.<br><br>Now, let us depart. We must make haste, if we are to corner our former companion."
// Answer Text :
"P14455407" "Alright. I'll see you there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Proton 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P44237657" "You... you don't know what you've done, {HeroName}.<br><br>You may think you've done a good thing today. You may even believe that for the rest of your life. But you will be wrong."
// Answer Text :
"P253033252" "You're confused, Proton. You need help."
// Page NeedHelp Text :
"P1695644092" "I do NOT need- bah! It's pointless to even try at this point.<br><br>I'll never understand why you can live in a world where the supernatural is commonplace, where time travel has been <i>documented</i>, and still you refuse to believe that I could come from a different time.<br><br>You seemed smarter than that, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P1765547785" "Proton, those people were from another dimension - Praetoria. That's a fact."
// Page Praetoria Text :
"P516794462" "I... I don't know what you're...<br><br><color orange>Proton trails off, staring at nothing. After a moment, he looks up at you.</color><br><br>{HeroName}, I don't understand. I had a life there, I have memories - I remember meeting Maelstrom when I was a teenager. What you're telling me... it's like you're trying to convince me that I'm not me."
// Answer Text :
"P2512130055" "You may not be, Proton. I think they did something to you... something to your head."
// Page YourHead Text :
"P670587004" "<color orange>Proton frowns. He stares at the floor, lost in thought.</color><br><br>You're telling me... that everything I know is a lie? That my every memory was planted?<br><br>That... that I almost killed thousands of people... for nothing?"
// Answer Text :
"P1808911353" "You can't blame yourself. The Praetorians did this to you."
// Page Blame Text :
"P450330484" "<color orange>Proton remains silent. It's clear he has a lot to think about.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4174907047" "I'm sorry, Proton. We're going to get you some help. I promise."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Twinshot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3273742813" "Hey, kiddo. That was pretty rough in there. How you holding up?"
// Answer Text :
"P2763176490" "Could be worse. How's Proton?"
// Page Proton Text :
"P3202739844" "He's... he's not doing so hot, kiddo. Manticore said they could get him some help, maybe have someone go over his memories. Try to tease out the fake from the real. I'm holding out hope for the guy.<br><br><color orange>Twinshot stares at you dead-on.</color><br><br>Grym told me what you two had planned. Bold action, kiddo."
// Answer Text :
"P452059963" "I'm sorry, Twinshot. Under the circumstances..."
// Page Circumstances Text :
"P1192577155" "I know, I know. I've been so shady with you guys lately, I must have seemed more suspicious than a Sky Raider in drag. I don't blame you, really.<br><br><color orange>Twinshot smirks at you.</color><br><br>Stings a little, but I don't blame you."
// Answer Text :
"P2880364641" "So what happens now?"
// Page HappensNow Text :
"P1602919580" "I think the Shining Stars are on temporary hiatus, kiddo. Manticore's basically put a hold on any Hero work I do until he can make sense of my past. He doesn't really like the fact that I used to be chummy with Eddie. The Phalanx doesn't like Praetoria one bit, let me tell you.<br><br>Still, even though Proton and I are out of the picture, you're pretty much in the clear. No reason for you to stop fighting the good fight, you know?<br><br><color orange>Twinshot flashes you her trademark grin.</color><br><br>I think you'll go far, kiddo. I really do."
// Answer Text :
"P2676007352" "Thanks, Twinshot. I'll see you around."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4128138588" "Here's the deal, kiddo: I think I may know how the Praetorians have been getting in. It's not much more than a hunch, but if I'm right I can end this, right now. I've been talking with some old colleagues of mine, and they provided me with... well, it was <i>highly</i> interesting. I don't really have time to go into it now, though.<br><br>I'm going to head back to base, and see if I can find the lynchpin to this case."
// AcceptString :
"P3032625880" "What do you want me to do?"
// SendOffString :
"P631594196" "You hang tight, kiddo. This... this is something I need to do solo.<br><br>I'm sorry, {HeroName}. I know you want to help, and you've put as much work into this case as anyone, but what's happening here... it's way over our heads. It's the sort of thing that I can't involve you in.<br><br>Try to understand, kiddo. I'll talk to you later...<br><br><color orange>Twinshot pauses, staring at nothing for a moment.</color><br><br>...I think."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P834875379" "<color deepskyblue>What the Future Holds</color>"

