// SaysList :
"P396291645" "<t 3><t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>T-Twinshot! What are you doing here?<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>I'm bringing this whole operation down, Proton. Starting with you.<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>Twinshot, I don't understand-<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>TWINSHOT! Calm down! There's no need for weapons here!<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>We're past the point of talking, Proton. This ends... now."
// SaysList :
"P305280210" "<t 3><t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>Please, just stop for a moment. Put down the gun. Let me explain.<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>I don't WANT your explanations, Proton!<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>But you don't understand what's at stake here! I know it seems bad, but this planet's very future is in jeapordy! That's why I needed to do this!<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>Proton, I don't know if you're a liar or insane, but I can tell you right now, that is NOT the future. Trust me. I've been there."
// SaysList :
"P2107671521" "<t 3><t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>I'm sorry. I wish it didn't have to be this way.<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>It doesn't, Proton! You can stop, right here, right now! You can close that thing and end this!<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color skyblue><bgcolor darkblue>It's for the best, Twinshot. I tried to help you understand, to listen to reason. Now I have to resort to other means.<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>'Other means'? Are you threatening me, you metal-plated piece of-<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Black>Oh. It's you. I see. It... it all makes sense now."

